@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@bearerToken = your_bearer_token_here

### Test Hello API (No authentication required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/Shakoora
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Hello API with different name
GET {{baseUrl}}/hello/Alice
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test Add API (Requires Azure AD authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/add/10/20
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

###

### Test Subtract API (Requires Azure AD authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subtract/100/50
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

###

### Test Add API with decimal numbers
GET {{baseUrl}}/add/10.5/20.75
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

###

### Test Add API with negative numbers
GET {{baseUrl}}/add/-5/10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

###

### Test FastAPI docs (OpenAPI/Swagger)
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs
Content-Type: text/html

###

### Test OpenAPI schema
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Content-Type: application/json

###

## Step 1: Client sends initialize request
## Node the session Id as that is what we will use in the next step
POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2025-03-26",
    "capabilities": {
      "roots": { "listChanged": true },
      "sampling": {}
    },
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "vscode",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: dc6af4be3b8c440f8538be91ce494818

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/list",
  "params": {}
}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Mcp-Session-Id: dc6af4be3b8c440f8538be91ce494818

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "add",
    "arguments": {
      "a": 20,
      "b": 30
    }
  }
}